The poster PDF embeds subsets of EB Garamond and Fira Mono, which use the SIL Open Font License 1.1. It also embeds the Computer Modern and AMS math fonts from the TeX distribution, which use the SIL Open Font License.

The paper PDF and one test fixture, tests/fixtures/kerned_subset_font.pdf, embed URW Nimbus fonts from the TeX distribution. Their license is the GNU General Public License with a special exception that permits embedding them in a PDF document. These files also embed Computer Modern and AMS math fonts.

